+++ b/changelog/5103.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+The assertion rewriter now unrolls comprehensions passed to ``all()`` and
+``any()``, so that a failing ``assert all(...)`` or ``assert any(...)`` reports
+the element for which the predicate failed, just like an equivalent ``for``
+loop would.
